==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kk sb dagur|afmælis}}

===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[afmæli]]'' "[[birthday]]" (''[[afæmlis]]'' "of a birthday") + ''[[dagur]]'' "[[day]]". It literally means "day of a birthday" or "birthday's day".

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|[ˈavmaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]}} (correctly) or {{IPA|[ˈamːaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]}} (colloquially)

===Noun===
